## Workflows — recipes for specific video types

- [`narration-explainer/`](docs/workflows/narration-explainer/) — TTS or pre-recorded VO + per-beat visuals
- [`news-video/`](docs/workflows/news-video/) — recurring on-screen cast, b-roll cutaways
- [`music-video/`](docs/workflows/music-video/) — mp3 → Gemini analysis → Seedance cuts → ffmpeg assemble
- [`format-rip/`](docs/workflows/format-rip/) — clone a video's pacing/structure into a reusable pack
- [`style-rip/`](docs/workflows/style-rip/) — clone a video's visual style into a reusable pack
- [`character-asset/`](docs/workflows/character-asset/) — produce a transparent (alpha) character video asset
- [`video-clone/`](docs/workflows/video-clone/) — recreate an existing video shot-by-shot

